model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's base for M0's load-code fixtures (invented): the joint model jown's one member, a place kind that keeps parts by owner"

source card "T's fixture card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind persons: parties

kind savings: place PLN min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w prorata

place sav: savings lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input amt: money PLN

input day: date

def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule base v card_2026 = (if p == ania then 1 else 0)

move dep: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to sav amount amt

ask q: bal(sav, 2026-12-31) of p for p in parties on 2026-12-31

version card_cast
  cite card
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1988-04-12..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1986-09-03..

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "the card"
  day = 2026-02-10 "the card"
  opening[sav] = 30.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  opening[sav] of ania = 10.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  opening[sav] of tomek = 20.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
